---
// Componente "Our Services" idéntico al diseño de la plantilla
---
<section style="background: #ffffff; padding: 100px 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
        <!-- Encabezado de la Sección -->
        <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 60px auto;">
            <span style="color: #6366f1; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #6366f1; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                OUR SERVICES
            </span>
            <h2 style="font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.2;">
                Expert Solutions and Services to Grow Your Brand
            </h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid de Tarjetas de Servicios -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 50px;">
            
            <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
            <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 24px; padding: 45px 35px; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <!-- Icono Contenedor -->
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <svg width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="1.5"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Título -->
                    <h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 15px 0; line-height: 1.35;">
                        Google Business Profile Optimization
                    </h3>
                    <!-- Descripción -->
                    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">
                        We identify high-performing keywords that your audience.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <!-- Enlace Read More -->
                <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 20px;">
                    <a href="/services" style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px;">
                        Read More 
                        <span style="background: #6366f1; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
            <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 24px; padding: 45px 35px; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <svg width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M12 11h4M12 16h4M8 11h.01M8 16h.01"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 15px 0; line-height: 1.35;">
                        Advanced Keyword Research & Planning
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">
                        We identify high-performing keywords that your audience.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 20px;">
                    <a href="/services" style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px;">
                        Read More 
                        <span style="background: #6366f1; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
            <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 24px; padding: 45px 35px; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <svg width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"/><path d="M19 10v1a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-1M12 18.5V22"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 15px 0; line-height: 1.35;">
                        Voice Search Optimisation Strategies
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">
                        We identify high-performing keywords that your audience.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 20px;">
                    <a href="/services" style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px;">
                        Read More 
                        <span style="background: #6366f1; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Pie de sección con etiqueta Free -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;">Free</span>
                Let's make something great work together. 
                <a href="/services" style="color: #6366f1; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">View Our All Services.</a>
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>